I checked every change against items A1–I2 and found seven gaps. Six are fixed and one needs your decision. Both checks were re-run: `build-agents.sh --check` passes, and `verify.sh` fails 6 checks that also failed before I changed anything. Nothing is committed or pushed.

## Check results
- **`./config/pi/build-agents.sh --check`:** `OK: AGENTS/CLAUDE files match fragments`, exit 0.
- **`TSC=…/typescript@5.9.3/bin/tsc ./config/pi/verify.sh`:** `58 passed, 6 failed`, exit 1. The baseline was 62 passed and 7 failed. The 6 failures:
